Pe dată de 2011-07-21 05:50, Dasein a scris:
> OK so I've got a Barbarian (human chaotic) up to level 11, he's
> cleared mines, cleared Sokoban (with an amulet of reflection), came
> across on altar on level 7 I think, converted it, sacced a whole bunch
> of corpses via a wand of create monster, and received Cleaver and a
> bit later, Fire Brand.
> Pretty simple noob question: which one should I use?
Average damage is 10.5/12 with Cleaver (against small/large monsters)
and 4.5/6.5 with Fire Brand, leaving all other things aside.  Other
effects for consideration are FB's double damage against non
fire-resistant monsters (many before Gehennom aren't), its better to-hit
bonus against them, and the fire resistance it grants you.  Also,
training the axe school isn't usually leading anywhere – there are far
more useful long sword artifacts than axes.  I'd recommend Fire Brand.

